{{> header}}

<h1>Reset Your Password</h1>

<p>Hello {{fullName}},</p>

<p>We received a request to reset the password for your Dwella account. If you made this request, click the link below to reset your password.</p>

<p>
    <a href='{{resetLink}}'>Reset Password</a>
</p>

<p>Or copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>
<p>{{resetLink}}</p>

<p><strong>Important:</strong> This reset link will expire in {{expirationTime}}.</p>

<p>If you didn't request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email. Your password will remain unchanged.</p>

<p>If you have any questions, please contact our support team.</p>

{{> footer}}